  "content": {
    "id": "p6-q104-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Simplify $\\sec(n\\pi-\\theta)$ for integer $n$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$(-1)^n\\sec\\theta$, where $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.\n\nUse reciprocal cosine and distinguish even and odd $n$.",
      "worked": "For even $n$, $\\cos(n\\pi-\\theta)=\\cos\\theta$; for odd $n$, $\\cos(n\\pi-\\theta)=-\\cos\\theta$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sec(n\\pi-\\theta)&=\\frac{1}{\\cos(n\\pi-\\theta)}\\\\\\sec(n\\pi-\\theta)&=\\frac{1}{(-1)^n\\cos\\theta}\\\\\\sec(n\\pi-\\theta)&=(-1)^n\\sec\\theta\\end{align*}$$\n\nBoth expressions are defined when $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 46
  },
